// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): the TLS client in Velt on the reactor
// (std/net/tls/fd_client.velt) for a program whose TCP functions are std/net/tcp_sched.velt (every
// native program's) that names `connectTls`, `WebSocket` or `connectWebSocket` (whose `wss:`
// connects with it). Other programs don't load the client.
// load when std/net/tcp_sched uses: connectTls WebSocket connectWebSocket
import "velt/net/tls/fd_client";
